"Pinpad terminal с BLE. NDA libdatecs_pinpad.so\n"
"            driver. Default port /dev/ttyACM0 ако serial. BLE bridge към\n"
"            PTY (memory: project_bluepad55_ble_bridge)."
msgstr ""
"Pinpad терминал с BLE. NDA libdatecs_pinpad.so\n"
"            драйвер. Порт по подразбиране /dev/ttyACM0 ако е serial. BLE мост към\n"
"            PTY (memory: project_bluepad55_ble_bridge)."

